# Scoped to .githooks on purpose. core.autocrlf=true would check these out as
# CRLF, and "#!/bin/sh\r" is not a valid interpreter on Linux or macOS.
# Deliberately NOT repo-wide: the rest of the tree is CRLF on disk and a global
# rule would renormalise all 19,405 lines in one commit.
.githooks/** text eol=lf
# Same reason: agent-skill scripts run under bash on every OS.
.agents/**/*.sh text eol=lf
